cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BLEECAM in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "BLEECAM: Benchmarking Life Cycle Environmental, Economic, and Social Metrics for Critical and Advanced Minerals and Materials"
abstract: >-
  BLEECAM is a multi-objective optimization framework that benchmarks and optimizes
  global critical-mineral and advanced-material supply-chain scenarios across economic
  (TEA/LCC), environmental (LCA-derived), and social (S-LCA) dimensions, including the
  multi-objective trade-off frontier. Developed at the National Laboratory of the
  Rockies (NLR) with funding from the U.S. Department of Energy's Advanced Materials
  and Manufacturing Technologies Office (DOE AMMTO).
type: software
version: "0.1.0-beta.1"
date-released: "2026-08-26"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
